    "For the 72t term use integration by parts: 72[t e^(−0.8t)/(−0.8) − ∫e^(−0.8t)/(−0.8) dt]",
    "P = −90t e^(−0.8t) − 112.5e^(−0.8t) + 135e^(−0.8t) + c",
    "Substitute t = 0 and P = 58.5: 58.5 = 0 + 22.5 + c, so c = 36",
