     "S₄ = a(1 − r⁴)/(1 − r) = 15",
     "S∞ = a/(1 − r) = 16, so a = 16(1 − r)",
     "Substitute into S₄: 16(1 − r)(1 − r⁴)/(1 − r) = 15 → 16(1 − r⁴) = 15",
